      "instance_name": "propaganda",
      "label": "Propaganda",
      "description": "Information, especially of a biased or misleading nature, used to promote a particular political cause or point of view. The meme's intent is propagandistic, aiming to influence perception by suggesting that systemic or organizational failure is the result of collective inaction rather than individual malfeasance.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_1e359830"
