      "description": "The meme uses a rhetorical device to deflect accountability by attributing collective responsibility to a group rather than a single individual, aiming to influence perception and shift blame. This is a propagandistic tactic.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_1e359830"
